# The Road Forks, the Ivy killed at the wrong San d'Oria status (mission.cop.the_road_forks#ivy2). A level 75 Warrior
# of San d'Oria with 3-3 current (a GM). Carpenter's Landing, San d'Oria status 5: Guilloud spawns and claims the Ivy;
# the status set to 2 (a GM); the Ivy killed: nothing.
lists CarpentersLanding/Guilloud/onTrigger CarpentersLanding/Overgrown_Ivy/onMobDeath
char zone=CarpentersLanding pos=-123.7,-6.6,-469 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
login
missionstatus Cop 5 pos=0               # a GM
trigger Guilloud                        # 5: the Ivy spawned and claimed
finish-if-event
missionstatus Cop 2 pos=0               # a GM
kill OVERGROWN_IVY                      # 2: nothing
